    "text": "By Dakota Smith ,\n12 hours ago OCALA, Fla. — Gleckler and Sons has announced the opening of a new 60,000-plus-square-foot facility in Ocala, Florida, further expanding its manufacturing and distribution presence across the state. The Ocala operation will support the manufacturing of roof and floor trusses, millwork production, and the operation of a full-service lumberyard... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
